[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Public High Level Requirements
UID: GSSC-PUBLIC-HIGH-LEVEL-REQUIREMENTS
VERSION: 5.0.0

[GRAMMAR]
ELEMENTS:
- TAG: TEXT
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: SECTION
  PROPERTIES:
    IS_COMPOSITE: True
    PREFIX: None
    VIEW_STYLE: Narrative
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: REQUIREMENT
  PROPERTIES:
    PREFIX: GSSC-PHLR-
    VIEW_STYLE: Table
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: RATIONALE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: COMMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: DERIVED
    TYPE: SingleChoice(True, False)
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: CHANGE_DRIVER
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: REVIEW_STATUS
    TYPE: SingleChoice(Changed, Approved, Baselined)
    REQUIRED: True
  RELATIONS:
  - TYPE: Parent
    ROLE: Refines
    REVERSE_ROLE: Refined By

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-APPLICATION
TITLE: Application Requirements

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-PUBLIC-FRONTEND
TITLE: Public Frontend

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-128
TITLE: Public Frontend Application
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website SHALL have a publicly accessible frontend application.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is the Public Frontend. The other public requirements describe that application. The Member Frontend is a separate application.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-1
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-129
TITLE: Public Primary Domain
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend SHALL be on the public-facing primary domain.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Public Frontend is the application on the public-facing primary domain. This requirement does not set the domain name. The Member Frontend is the members-only subdomain.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-1
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-HEADER
TITLE: Header Requirements

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-IDENTITY
TITLE: Header Identity

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-1
TITLE: Header Logo
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL include the GSSC Logo in every layout.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires a logo. The legacy public site shows the GSSC Logo. The Header includes that logo whether or not the layout also has room for the organization's name.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-19
TITLE: Header Organization Name
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL include the name of the Genealogical Society of Stanislaus County, either in full or as an acronym, when the layout permits.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires the organization's name in the Header. The legacy public site displays the society's full name. The Header includes that name, or the acronym, only when the layout has room for it. The GSSC Logo remains present either way.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-ACCOUNT-ACCESS
TITLE: Header Account Access

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-2
TITLE: Header Login
STATEMENT: >>>
When no member is logged in, the Header Login option SHALL redirect the visitor to the members-only application.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The legacy public site has no login in its Header. The members-only application is the Member Frontend. Choosing login takes the visitor there.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-9
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-18
TITLE: Header Member Access
STATEMENT: >>>
When a member is logged in, the Header SHALL offer access to the members-only application in place of Header Login.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A logged-in member still needs a way to open the Member Frontend. That option replaces login rather than appearing beside it. Logout remains a separate option.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-9
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-8
TITLE: Header Greeting
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL greet a member who is logged in.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires a greeting. The legacy public site has none in its Header. This requirement shows a logged-in member that the Header recognizes them.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-9
TITLE: Header Logout
STATEMENT: >>>
When a member is logged in, the Header Logout option SHALL log that member out of the members-only application and leave the visitor on the public page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires logout. The legacy public site has none in its Header. A logged-in member needs a way to end the Member Frontend session. Logout ends that session and leaves the visitor on the public page.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[[/SECTION]]

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-3
TITLE: Header Contact
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL open an overlay in which a visitor can draft a message to the organization.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires a way to contact the society. The legacy public site has no message overlay. This requirement gives the Header a contact option that opens an overlay for drafting a message. The society's phone number, email address, and postal address are shown in the Footer.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-4
TITLE: Header Site Search
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL provide a way to search the site.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires site search, and the legacy public site does not provide it. This requirement adds a Header search so a visitor can find content on the site.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-NAVIGATION
TITLE: Navigation Menu

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-5
TITLE: Navigation Menu
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL include a Navigation Menu.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires a menu in the Header. The legacy public site presents a menu of its main pages. This requirement places that menu in the Header. Each page the menu opens is a separate requirement. The membership application from the legacy menu is not included.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-10
TITLE: Home Page Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Navigation Menu SHALL provide access to the public home page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is how a visitor reaches the public home page from the Header. The requirement does not set the entry's label.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-2
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-11
TITLE: Membership Information Page Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Navigation Menu SHALL provide access to the public membership information page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is how a visitor reaches the public membership information page from the Header. The requirement does not set the entry's label.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-3
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-126
TITLE: Leadership Page Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Navigation Menu SHALL provide access to the public leadership page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is how a visitor reaches the public leadership page from the Header. The requirement does not set the entry's label.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-4
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-12
TITLE: Calendar Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Navigation Menu SHALL provide access to the public calendar.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is how a visitor reaches the public calendar from the Header. The requirement does not set the entry's label.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-5
  ROLE: Refines

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-PUBLICATIONS
TITLE: Publications

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-13
TITLE: Publications Page Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Navigation Menu SHALL provide access to the public publications page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is how a visitor reaches the public publications page from the Header. The requirement does not set the entry's label. Access reached through this page is specified separately.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-7
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-16
TITLE: Cemetery Project Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Navigation Menu SHALL provide access to the Stanislaus County Cemetery Project as a child of access to the public publications page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The legacy menu lists its pages in one flat list. The Public Frontend has pages for the Stanislaus County Cemetery Project, and this requirement reaches those pages through the public publications page. The requirement does not set the entry's label.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-18
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-7
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-17
TITLE: War Veterans Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Navigation Menu SHALL provide access to the War Veterans of Stanislaus County publication as a child of access to the public publications page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The legacy menu lists its pages in one flat list. The Public Frontend has pages for that publication, including Civil War veterans and veterans of other wars, and this requirement reaches those pages through the public publications page. The requirement does not set the entry's label.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-19
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-7
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-14
TITLE: Research Tools Page Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Navigation Menu SHALL provide access to the public research tools page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is how a visitor reaches the public research tools page from the Header. The requirement does not set the entry's label.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
