- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-6
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-15
TITLE: Newsletters Page Access
STATEMENT: >>>
The Navigation Menu SHALL provide access to the public newsletters page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is how a visitor reaches the public newsletters page from the Header. The requirement does not set the entry's label.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
