[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-FOOTER
TITLE: Footer Requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-20
TITLE: Footer Contact
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Footer SHALL open an overlay in which a visitor can draft a message to the organization.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires a footer contact option. The legacy footer offers a webmaster email address. This requirement instead opens an overlay for drafting a message. The society's phone number, email address, and postal address are separate Footer requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-24
TITLE: Footer Phone Number
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Footer SHALL include the society's phone number.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires the society's phone number. The legacy public page shows it at the top of the page. This requirement places that phone number in the Footer, separate from the message overlay. It does not set the current number.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-25
TITLE: Footer Email Address
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Footer SHALL include the society's email address.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires the society's email address. The legacy public page shows it at the top of the page. This requirement places that email address in the Footer, separate from the message overlay. It does not set the current address.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-26
TITLE: Footer Postal Address
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Footer SHALL include the society's postal address.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires the society's postal address. The legacy public page shows it at the top of the page. This requirement places that postal address in the Footer, separate from the message overlay. It does not set the current address.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-21
TITLE: Footer Organization Name
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Footer SHALL include the full name of the Genealogical Society of Stanislaus County.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires the organization's name in the Footer. The legacy footer includes the society's full name. This requirement keeps that full name in the Footer and does not allow the acronym in its place.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-22
TITLE: Footer Copyright
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Footer SHALL include a copyright statement.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires a copyright statement. The legacy public site includes a copyright notice and the words "All Rights Reserved." This requirement keeps a copyright statement in the Footer and does not set its wording.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-23
TITLE: Footer Social Media
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Footer SHALL include links to the society's social media.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR requires social media links. The legacy public site links to the society's Facebook page. This requirement keeps links to the society's social media in the Footer and does not name the services.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-ANNOUNCEMENTS
TITLE: Announcement Requirements

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-URGENT-ANNOUNCEMENT-CONTAINER
TITLE: Urgent Announcement Container

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-27
TITLE: Urgent Announcement Placement
STATEMENT: >>>
The Urgent Announcement Container SHALL hold each urgent public announcement on every public page except the home page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Public announcements are allocated by GSSC-PIR-33. This requirement places the urgent ones on the other public pages. What makes a public announcement urgent is defined with the backend requirements. The home page announcements display is a separate feature and is defined separately. The legacy public site has no container of this kind.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-33
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-34
TITLE: Urgent Announcement Selection
STATEMENT: >>>
Selecting an announcement in the Urgent Announcement Container SHALL redirect the visitor to the home page announcements display, focused on that announcement.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The container is a way to reach the selected announcement on the home page. The home page announcements display is defined separately.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-10
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-33
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-URGENT-ANNOUNCEMENT-CONTENTS
TITLE: Urgent Announcement Contents

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-30
TITLE: Urgent Announcement Title
STATEMENT: >>>
The Urgent Announcement Contents SHALL include the title of an urgent public announcement.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The title is part of the data for an urgent public announcement. The home page announcements display is defined separately.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-10
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-33
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PHLR-31
TITLE: Urgent Announcement Text
STATEMENT: >>>
The Urgent Announcement Contents SHALL include the text of an urgent public announcement.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The text is part of the data for an urgent public announcement. The home page announcements display is defined separately.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-10
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-33
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

